sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Surface as CLI / Web / Voice / Widget
    participant Runtime as AssistantRuntime
    participant Orch as JarvisOrchestrator
    participant Memory as Unified Memory
    participant Router as AgentRouter
    participant Model as Selected LLM backend
    participant Registry as Tool Registry
    participant Policy as Policy + approval gate
    participant Tool as Tool / connector adapter
    participant Verify as Verifier
    participant State as TaskStateManager
    participant Events as EventBus + event store

    User->>Surface: Submit goal or transcript
    Surface->>Runtime: Resolve shared singleton runtime
    Runtime->>Orch: Route request to canonical orchestrator
    Orch->>Memory: Recall relevant context and prior experience
    Orch->>Router: Select backend for task profile
    Router-->>Orch: Backend and routing decision
    Orch->>Model: Send prompt, memory context, and tool contract
    Model-->>Orch: Answer or structured tool call
    alt Tool call required
        Orch->>Registry: Parse and resolve tool
        Registry->>Policy: Evaluate capability, risk, paths, and approval
        alt Approval required
            Policy-->>Surface: Request explicit approval
            User-->>Surface: Approve or reject
            Surface-->>Policy: Approval decision
        end
        Policy->>Tool: Dispatch permitted action
        Tool-->>Registry: Result, artifacts, or error
        Registry-->>Orch: Tool execution record
        Orch->>Verify: Check post-conditions and evidence
        Verify->>State: Persist outcome, checkpoint, and evidence
        Verify->>Events: Publish task and evidence events
        Orch->>Model: Continue with verified result
        Model-->>Orch: Final response or next tool call
    else Direct response
        Model-->>Orch: Final response
    end
    Orch->>State: Persist final task/session outcome
    Orch->>Events: Publish completion or failure event
    Orch-->>Surface: Evidence-backed response and task status
    Surface-->>User: Render result, history, and available continuation
